  <item>
    <title>N.7 厨房里的展览</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65c1eb89dde969cfdc656c0f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65c1eb89dde969cfdc656c0f</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 06 Feb 2024 08:19:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>提到艺术展览，你会联想到什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>或许是知名的艺术家、策展人？</span></p><span></span><p><span>亦或是精致、宽敞的展馆？</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span>你有没有想过</span></p><span></span><p><span>在自家的厨房里也可以举办一场展览？</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span>受知名策展人Hans Ulrich Obrist的启发，</span></p><span></span><p><span>留法校友小柯在法国学习期间</span></p><span></span><p><span>与同学们共同策划完成了一场《厨房里的展览》。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这次经历不仅帮助她拓展了艺术认知的边界，</span></p><span></span><p><span>还让她走进不同同学的厨房，</span></p><span></span><p><span>感受到鲜活的生活艺术之美……</span></p>]]></description>
